{MPLTEXT 1 249 0 "" }}}}{SECT 1 {PARA 218 "" 0 "" {TEXT 336 24 "Basic \+
worksheet handling" }}{PARA 219 "" 0 "" {TEXT 337 0 "" }}{EXCHG {PARA 
230 "" 0 "" {TEXT 224 174 "Here we indicate how to start a new workshe
et,  make a title, indicate author, insert Standard Math (that is,  a \+
mathematical formula) in text, and how to save a worksheet.  " }{TEXT 
217 0 "" }{TEXT 224 1 "\n" }{TEXT 224 1 "\n" }{TEXT 224 9 "1. Under " 
}{TEXT 218 4 "File" }{TEXT 224 20 " on the menu choose " }{TEXT 218 3 
"New" }{TEXT 224 17 " or click on the " }{TEXT 219 16 "blank page icon
 " }{TEXT 224 42 "on the menu bar.  This opens a new page.  " }{TEXT 
217 0 "" }}{PARA 216 "" 0 "" {TEXT 220 0 "" }}{PARA 215 "" 0 "" {TEXT 
201 30 "2.  Next go to the menu named " }{TEXT 203 6 "Window" }{TEXT 
201 18 " and pull down to " }{TEXT 203 8 "Vertical" }{TEXT 201 190 ". \+
This will allow you to read this worksheet while following these direc
tions in the new worksheet.  Click on the blank worksheet to make sure
 the cursor is there and not in this worksheet.\n" }{TEXT 201 1 "\n" }
{TEXT 201 8 "3. Press" }{TEXT 203 10 " crtl + t " }{TEXT 201 16 "or cl
ick on the " }{TEXT 203 1 "T" }{TEXT 201 76 " icon on the menu bar. Th
en, on the left side of the menu bar where it says " }{TEXT 203 8 "P N
ormal" }{TEXT 201 45 " pull down the menu at that point and select " }
{TEXT 203 7 "P Title" }{TEXT 201 20 ". Type in the words " }{TEXT 203 
12 "Sample Title" }{TEXT 201 43 " and then hit return. This will put y
ou in " }{TEXT 203 8 "P Author" }{TEXT 201 34 " mode. Type your name a
nd the hit " }{TEXT 203 6 "Return" }{TEXT 201 21 ". You will now be in
 " }{TEXT 203 8 "P Normal" }{TEXT 201 57 " text mode.  Type the words \+
\"Some sample Maple commands.\"" }{TEXT 203 0 "" }}{PARA 216 "" 0 "" 
{TEXT 220 0 "" }}{PARA 215 "" 0 "" {TEXT 201 17 "4. Next click on " }
{TEXT 203 2 "[>" }{TEXT 201 10 " or press " }{TEXT 203 6 "ctrl +" }
{TEXT 201 56 " . [Sometimes you may want to insert an execution group 
" }{TEXT 292 6 "before" }{TEXT 201 76 " the cursor--especially if you \+
are at the top of the page. Then you may use " }{TEXT 203 8 "ctrl + k"
 }{TEXT 201 3 ".]\n" }{TEXT 201 1 " " }{TEXT 203 0 "" }}{PARA 204 "" 0
 "" {TEXT 224 81 "When you see the prompt, i.e., >, then type in some \+
mathematical command such as " }{TEXT 298 6 "2^100;" }{TEXT 217 2 ". "
 }{TEXT 224 71 "Then hit return to execute this command. Try a few mor
e such commands. " }{TEXT 217 0 "" }}{PARA 219 "" 0 "" {TEXT 337 0 "" 
}}{PARA 220 "" 0 "" {TEXT 334 57 "5. Go back to the text mode by repea
ting clicking on the " }{TEXT 335 1 "T" }{TEXT 334 32 " in the menu ba
r or by pressing " }{TEXT 335 8 "ctrl + t" }{TEXT 334 53 ".  Type in t
he words \"We now compute the integral\" .\n" }{TEXT 334 1 "\n" }{TEXT
 334 11 "Next press " }{TEXT 335 8 "ctrl + r" }{TEXT 334 104 ".  You w
ill see a ?.  Now type in int(x^2,x=1..2) you will see this appear in \+
a box under the menu bar. " }}{PARA 219 "" 0 "" {TEXT 337 0 "" }}
{PARA 220 "" 0 "" {TEXT 334 4 "Now " }{TEXT 335 8 "ctrl + t" }{TEXT 
334 136 " again or click on the T to go back into ordinary text mode a
nd continue to type the words \"as follows\".  You should see the foll
owing:\n" }{TEXT 334 1 "\n" }{TEXT 334 28 "We now compute the integral
 " }{XPPEDIT 18 0 "Typesetting:-mrow(Typesetting:-mi(\"\"), Typesettin
g:-mrow(Typesetting:-msubsup(Typesetting:-mo(\"&int;\", mathvariant = \+
\"normal\", fence = \"false\", separator = \"false\", stretchy = \"fal
se\", symmetric = \"false\", largeop = \"false\", movablelimits = \"fa
lse\", accent = \"false\", lspace = \"0.0em\", rspace = \"0.0em\"), Ty
pesetting:-mn(\"1\", mathvariant = \"normal\"), Typesetting:-mn(\"2\",
 mathvariant = \"normal\"), superscriptshift = \"2\", subscriptshift =
 \"0\"), Typesetting:-mi(\"\"), Typesetting:-mrow(Typesetting:-msup(Ty
pesetting:-mi(\"x\", italic = \"true\", mathvariant = \"italic\"), Typ
esetting:-mn(\"2\", mathvariant = \"normal\"), superscriptshift = \"0
\")), Typesetting:-mi(\"\"), Typesetting:-mspace(height = \"0.0ex\", w
idth = \"0.3em\", depth = \"0.0ex\", linebreak = \"auto\"), Typesettin
g:-mo(\"&DifferentialD;\", mathvariant = \"normal\", fence = \"false\"
, separator = \"false\", stretchy = \"false\", symmetric = \"false\", \+
largeop = \"false\", movablelimits = \"false\", accent = \"false\", ls
pace = \"0.0em\", rspace = \"0.0em\"), Typesetting:-mi(\"x\", italic =
 \"true\", mathvariant = \"italic\")), Typesetting:-mi(\"\"));" "-I%mr
owG6#/I+modulenameG6\"I,TypesettingGI(_syslibGF'6%-I#miGF$6#Q!F'-F#6)-
I(msubsupGF$6'-I#moGF$6-Q&&int;F'/%,mathvariantGQ'normalF'/%&fenceGQ&f
alseF'/%*separatorGF=/%)stretchyGF=/%*symmetricGF=/%(largeopGF=/%.mova
